WEBVTT

00:01:58.870 --> 00:02:00.429
Just because it is?

00:02:00.860 --> 00:02:05.776
Why can't it be a garden street
lined with trees,

00:02:05.800 --> 00:02:09.626
where people can actually meet
and walk to the baker

00:02:09.650 --> 00:02:11.981
and kids can walk to school?

00:02:12.640 --> 00:02:18.016
Our acceptance of the dysfunctions
and indignities of modern cities

00:02:18.040 --> 00:02:20.326
has reached a peak.

00:02:20.350 --> 00:02:21.696
We need to change that.

00:02:21.720 --> 00:02:25.746
We need to change it
for the sake of justice,

00:02:25.770 --> 00:02:27.613
of our well-being

00:02:27.637 --> 00:02:29.793
and of the climate.